# Connector: thin pole all links route through — every cable/pipe/conveyor needs a Connector
# endpoint, and one Connector carries exactly ONE medium (power, fuel or minerals).
# Spawned origin 2.0 above ground. (File keeps its historic name; the game calls it Connector.)
Prefab gameConnector
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.85 0.85 0.9
		Scale 1
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1 1
